Article 7
Efforts to develop women's access to participate in the economic, political, social and cultural fields as referred to in Article 5 letter b, include:
a. the cultivation and development of women's entrepreneurship;
b. the improvement of Women's Empowerment in various professions;
c. the improvement of the role and function of women in political organizations;
d. the involvement of women to participate actively in development programs;
